Package: fraudaudit
Title: Statistical Feature Audits for the IEEE-CIS Fraud Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jakub", "Jewloszewicz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The audits that decide which columns reach the model, stated as
    statistics rather than as single-feature models. Every verdict is a rank
    statistic, a weight-of-evidence table or a two-sample test, so a rejection
    can be read as a sentence about a bin rather than as the output of a fit.
    Verdicts leave this package as contract fragments; nothing here trains a
    production model and nothing downstream recomputes a verdict.
